{#
    A page whose rows or cards change in place (Ui:InlineEdit): the change posts and comes back to
    the same address, which Turbo takes as a refresh of the page; it then morphs the page into the
    new one and keeps where it was scrolled, so the row stays under the pointer (Turbo, "Page
    refreshes": turbo-refresh-method morph, turbo-refresh-scroll preserve).
#}
<meta name="turbo-refresh-method" content="morph">
<meta name="turbo-refresh-scroll" content="preserve">
